            "columns_description" :
              [
                "Total gross area of all structures expressed in square feet rounded to the nearest integer, where applicable;  ",
                "An estimate of the exterior dimensions of the portion of the structure(s) allocated for retail use.",
                "The sum of residential units in all buildings on the tax lot.",
                "A code describing the basement.",
                "Sufficient information to determine the property’s current use or to determine that it has no current use; ",
                "The name of the Historic District as designated by the New York City Landmarks Preservation Commission.",
                "The number of structures",
                "The depth of the structure or structures, which is the effective perpendicular distance, measured in feet, where applicable; ",
                "The Version Number related to the release of PLUTO.",
                "Whether the property is located in an industrial business zone; ",
                "The health area; ",
                "The major use of the structure or structures, where applicable; ",
                "The year construction of the structure(s) was completed and whether such year is an estimate, where applicable; ",
                "The number of easements, where applicable; ",
                "For each property assigned to the economic development corporation, such list shall include the percentage of usable space actually occupied by a tenant or tenants.",
                "The 2010 census tract that the tax lot is located in.",
                "Allowable ratio of building floor area to the area of the property, where applicable; ",
                "The exterior dimensions of the portion of the structure or structures allocated for commercial use, where applicable; ",
                "The exterior dimensions of the portion of the structure or structures allocated for residential use, where applicable; ",
                "The special purpose district assigned to the tax lot.",
                "Whether the land is suitable for urban agriculture (for description, click “About” then “Attachments”)",
                "A code for the tax lot's land use category, modified for display of parks, New York City Department of Parks and Recreation properties and New York State Office of Parks, Recreation and Historic Preservation properties in the appropriate category on land ",
                "The health center district; ",
                "The e-designation number associated with the property, where applicable;",
                "The fire company that services the property; ",
                "The city council district that the tax lot is located in.",
                "The police precinct; ",
                "The zip code that the tax lot is located in.",
                "Whether the structure or structures are detached, semi-detached or attached to neighboring structures, where applicable; ",
                "Whether the property is irregularly shaped; ",
                "The borough that the tax lot is located in.",
                "The BIN (Building Identification Number) is a unique identifier for each building in the City",
                "The map on which the property appears in the most recent atlas of the city property",
                "The actual exempt total value, which is determined differently for each exemption program, is the dollar amount related to that portion of the tax lot that has received an exemption or abatement for Fiscal Year 2013.",
                "The tax block that the tax lot is located in.",
                "",
                "An estimate of the exterior dimensions of the portion of the structure(s) allocated for garage use.",
                "An estimate of the exterior dimensions of the portion of the structure(s) allocated for office use.",
                "The condominium number assigned to the complex, where applicable; ",
                "Whether the property is enrolled in a government cleanup, and if so, the name of such program;",
                "Ratio of building floor area to the area of the property, where applicable; ",
                "If a building has been altered more than once, this is the year of the most recent alteration.",
                "If a building has only been altered once, this is the date of the alteration.",
                "The primary zoning classification of the property; ",
                "The zoning designation occupying the second greatest percentage of the property’s area, where applicable; ",
                "The actual exempt land value, which is determined differently for each exemption program, is the dollar amount related to that portion of the tax lot that has received an exemption or abatement for Fiscal Year 2013.",
                "The community school district that the tax lot is located in.",
                "The primary commercial overlay assigned to the property, where applicable; ",
                "The 2010 census block that the tax lot is located in.",
                "The commercial overlay occupying the second greatest percentage of the property’s area, where applicable; ",
                "The special purpose district assigned to the tax lot.",
                "The coordinate of the XY coordinate pair that depicts the property’s approximate location as expressed in the New York-Long Island State Plane coordination system; ",
                "General Property name",
                "The community district (CD) or joint interest area (JIA) that the tax lot is located in, or partially located in.",
                "Agency contact information, including name, telephone number and email address.",
                "The number of the tax lot.",
                "An estimate of the exterior dimensions of the portion of the structure(s) allocated for other than Residential, Office, Retail, Garage, Storage, Loft or Factory use.",
                "An address for the tax lot.",
                "The Neighborhood Tabulation Area field indicates the New York City Neighborhood area where the site is located",
                "Total area, expressed in square feet and rounded to the nearest integer; ",
                "Latitude of property",
                "Whether the property contains the presence of an open petroleum spill;",
                "The city agency to which the property is assigned",
